# `/replaceitem entity` 的**槽位表**和**各实体的容器**。
#
# 1.12.2 的 `CommandReplaceItem` 静态块里有整张槽位表：
#   slot.container.0..53   -> 0..53
#   slot.hotbar.0..8       -> 0..8
#   slot.inventory.0..26   -> 9..35
#   slot.enderchest.0..26  -> 200..226
#   slot.villager.0..7     -> 300..307
#   slot.horse.0..14       -> 500..514
#   slot.weapon             -> 98
#   slot.weapon.mainhand    -> 98
#   slot.weapon.offhand     -> 99
#   slot.armor.head         -> 100 + EnumItemSlot.HEAD.b()  = 103
#   slot.armor.chest        -> 100 + EnumItemSlot.CHEST.b() = 102
#   slot.armor.legs         -> 100 + EnumItemSlot.LEGS.b()  = 101
#   slot.armor.feet         -> 100 + EnumItemSlot.FEET.b()  = 100
#   slot.horse.saddle       -> 400
#   slot.horse.armor        -> 401
#   slot.horse.chest        -> 499
#
# `EnumItemSlot.b()` 是枚举内序号（HEAD=3, CHEST=2, LEGS=1, FEET=0）。
#
# 这一轮问的是：**实体类型不同，容器不同**，所以同一个槽位在不同实体上
# 能不能放东西是不一样的。真服对放不进去的槽位报
# "Could not replace slot <slot> with <n> * [<item>]"。
#
# bot: Steve

--- console ---
say Z01
summon armor_stand 0 4 0 {CustomName:"SLOT_AS"}
say Z02
replaceitem entity @e[type=armor_stand] slot.inventory.18 stone
say Z03
replaceitem entity @e[type=armor_stand] slot.enderchest.0 stone
say Z04
replaceitem entity @e[type=armor_stand] slot.armor.head stone
say Z05
replaceitem entity @e[type=armor_stand] slot.weapon.offhand stone
say Z06
replaceitem entity @e[type=armor_stand] slot.container.40 stone
say Z07
replaceitem entity @e[type=armor_stand] slot.hotbar.3 stone
say Z08
replaceitem entity @e[type=armor_stand] slot.inventory.26 stone
say Z09
replaceitem entity @e[type=armor_stand] slot.horse.saddle stone
say Z10
replaceitem entity Steve slot.inventory.18 stone
say Z11
replaceitem entity Steve slot.armor.head stone
say Z12
replaceitem entity Steve slot.armor.chest stone
say Z13
replaceitem entity Steve slot.weapon.offhand stone
say Z14
replaceitem entity Steve slot.inventory.26 stone
say Z15
replaceitem entity Steve slot.enderchest.0 stone
say Z16
